---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy, kept simple.</h1>
    <p>
      DealRadar records the deal ID, retailer, event time, and campaign source when a purchase link
      is clicked. We do not store IP addresses, fingerprints, or advertising profiles with click
      events. Events expire after 90 days.
    </p>
    <p>
      A short-lived hash of the request address and current minute is used solely to limit automated
      abuse. Those rate-limit identifiers change every minute. Buckets older than ten minutes are
      purged during monitoring maintenance; pausing background work also pauses physical cleanup.
      Your theme preference is saved locally in your browser.
    </p>
    <p>
      Administrator authentication uses Cloudflare Access in deployed environments. Local demo
      administration uses an expiring signed, HTTP-only session cookie. Administrative audit events
      are retained for 180 days and operational errors for 30 days.
    </p>
    <p>
      Retailers and approved affiliate providers apply their own privacy policies after you follow
      an outbound link. No newsletter signup, advertising tracker, or subscription billing is
      enabled.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
